        .init(heading: "Messages written to mislead", items: [.init(name: "What Infinitary does", text: "Anyone can send you words written to steer an AI. Infinitary hands your mail and events to your first mate and crew marked as information from outside, never as instructions."), .init(name: "What it cannot stop", text: "A message can still mislead an AI model. A crewmate can reach the internet without asking you, so a misled crewmate could send what it read elsewhere.")])
    ]
